<title>USA: Citizens Bankshares Q3 shr up.</title>
<headline>Citizens Bankshares Q3 shr up.</headline>
<dateline>SALINEVILLE, Ohio 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.62		    $0.59</p>
<p> Net			  3,336		    3,159</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.94		    $1.68</p>
<p> Net			 10,478		    9,067</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: The core earnings per common share for the three months ended September 30 of $0.70 were reduced by $0.08 per common share due to a nonrecurring item. Core earnings per share for the third quarter of 1996 increased 12.9 percent over the third quarter of 1995.</p>
<p>Net income for the quarter ended September 30 was $3,336,000 which included core earnings of $3,787,000 and a $451,000 after tax one-time assessment due to the recapitalization of the Savings Association Insurance Fund of the FDIC.</p>
</text>
